<#b478ff>TIME STOP GAUGE</>
  The bar at the bottom of the screen starts every round
  empty.
  It only fills from landed bullets (+4% each, machine gun
  +1.2%)
  and from charging (about 4 seconds from empty).
Charge		^X
Time Stop (full gauge + 2 bars)		_F_DF_D_DB_B^X
  Stops time until the gauge runs out.
Time-Stop Finisher (50% gauge)		_D_DF_F^X
  Combo ender, ground only: frozen bullets, then a bomb.
  Hard knockdown.
Warp (10%)		_B^X / _D^X
Long Warp (30%)		_F^X
Dash Warp (during dash, 10%)		^X
  Warps fail when the gauge is too low.

<#b478ff>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves her
  open.
Grab		^Y
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
  Refills faster once a combo on her passes 15% of her life.
Dash		_F_F
Back Step		_B_B
Air Dash (air)		_F_F

<#b478ff>NORMALS</>
Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
  Chains: Light into Medium into Heavy.
Grenade (also in the air)		_F^C
Retreating Shot		_B^C
Bomb (explodes on touch)		_DB^C
Launcher (jump cancel on hit)		_DF^C
Dash Attack (during dash)		^C
Air Light / Medium		^A / ^B
  Air Medium cancels into an air dash on contact.
Charged Air Medium (hold, air)		^B
  Half or full charge drags them up and grants an extra
  jump. Once per combo.
Air Heavy: gunshot (air)		^C
Second Shot (air, 10% gauge)		^C
  Press again after the shot: ground bounce and control
  back.
  Air Heavy is then locked until the combo ends.

<#b478ff>SPECIALS</>
  The C version becomes the EX when she has a bar.
RPG-7		_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
  EX: AT-4.
Mortar		_F_D_DF^A / ^B / ^C
  EX: five shells at once.
Time-Stop Dodge		_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C
  Counter. EX: Killing Charlotte.
Assault Rifle (air)		_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
  EX: Minimi and a grenade.
Warp Shot		_B_D_DB^A / ^B / ^C
  EX: Time-Stop Combo (2 bars).
Detonate Bombs		_D_D^A / ^B / ^C
  EX: Bomb Room (2 bars).
